{"ticker":"SNOW","updated":"2026-10-30T23:12:46Z","profile":{"longName":"Snowflake Inc.","shortName":"Snowflake Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United States","website":"https://www.snowflake.com","fullTimeEmployees":9394,"marketCap":107985018880,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":101.1106,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":19.86974,"pegRatio":5.92,"targetMeanPrice":426.5002,"targetHighPrice":525.0,"targetLowPrice":110.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":48,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.351,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.6703,"operatingMargins":-0.17001,"profitMargins":-0.20071,"totalRevenue":5434647040,"beta":1.351,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":384.56,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":118.3,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Snowflake Inc. provides a cloud-based data platform for various organizations in the United States and internationally. The company's platform includes artificial intelligence (AI) Data Cloud, which enables customers to consolidate data into a single source of truth to drive meaningful business insights, build data applications, and share data and data products, as well as applies AI for solving business problems. It serves financial services, advertising, media and entertainment, retail and consumer goods, healthcare and life sciences, manufacturing, technology, telecom, travel and hospitality, and government and defense industries, as well as the public sector. the company has a collaboration with OpenAI, L.L.C. for the development of AI solutions for joint enterprise customers that deliver tangible return on investment. The company was formerly known as Snowflake Computing, Inc. and changed its name to Snowflake Inc. in April 2019. Snowflake Inc. was incorporated in 2012 and is based in Menlo Park, California.","summary_zh":"Snowflake Inc. 為美國和國際上的各個組織提供基於雲端的資料平台。該公司的平台包括人工智慧（AI）數據雲，使客戶能夠將數據整合為單一事實來源，以推動有意義的業務洞察、建立數據應用程式、共享數據和數據產品，以及應用人工智慧解決業務問題。它為金融服務、廣告、媒體和娛樂、零售和消費品、醫療保健和生命科學、製造、技術、電信、旅遊和酒店、政府和國防工業以及公共部門提供服務。該公司與 OpenAI, L.L.C. 合作。為聯合企業客戶開發人工智慧解決方案，帶來實際的投資回報。該公司前身為 Snowflake Computer, Inc.，於 2019 年 4 月更名為 Snowflake Inc.。 Snowflake Inc. 成立於 2012 年，總部位於加州門洛帕克。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":234.0,"h":235.26,"l":228.4,"c":233.6,"v":7218000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":234.85,"h":236.5,"l":227.844,"c":229.33,"v":6749000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":222.7,"h":224.05,"l":215.05,"c":221.9,"v":13280000},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":223.92,"h":226.5,"l":221.19,"c":225.58,"v":5889400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":226.84,"h":230.95,"l":225.995,"c":226.52,"v":4519500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":223.0,"h":225.83,"l":222.1,"c":225.56,"v":3949400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":229.9,"h":232.21,"l":224.02,"c":225.85,"v":5142100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":226.11,"h":228.66,"l":223.411,"c":224.53,"v":4152500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":224.5,"h":224.815,"l":220.81,"c":221.15,"v":2634700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":222.015,"h":228.54,"l":222.015,"c":225.79,"v":3722300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":221.24,"h":222.345,"l":215.95,"c":215.95,"v":7212200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":217.2,"h":219.01,"l":214.3,"c":217.96,"v":4366300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":219.995,"h":222.25,"l":218.51,"c":222.11,"v":3752600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":223.31,"h":231.94,"l":222.57,"c":230.48,"v":7774900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":228.91,"h":230.13,"l":225.33,"c":229.54,"v":3217100},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":230.16,"h":231.492,"l":222.88,"c":223.54,"v":4939300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":226.8,"h":228.06,"l":221.12,"c":222.57,"v":3259400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":219.5,"h":225.41,"l":217.27,"c":221.6,"v":3006200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":222.31,"h":225.971,"l":220.295,"c":224.64,"v":3014800},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":226.94,"h":230.33,"l":224.07,"c":225.25,"v":4429100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":225.84,"h":227.5,"l":221.52,"c":225.55,"v":3420000},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":223.88,"h":231.86,"l":222.64,"c":230.55,"v":4678300},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":235.0,"h":241.117,"l":234.01,"c":240.54,"v":6623100},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":2